WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:00.800
Tonight, debris

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.701
from a US Patriot

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:03.803
missile raining down on a street in Kyiv.

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:05.071
The stunning video proving that

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:06.172
the most sophisticated air

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:07.374
defense system in the world

00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:08.942
was used to stop Russia

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:09.542
when it fired

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:11.077
11 cruise and ballistic missiles

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:13.046
at the Ukrainian capital this week.

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:14.214
This comes as Yevgeny

00:00:14.214 --> 00:00:15.515
Prigozhin, the head of the Russian

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:16.149
private army,

00:00:16.149 --> 00:00:17.083
the Wagner group,

00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:18.284
lashed out in a response

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:18.885
to a question

00:00:18.885 --> 00:00:19.786
from CNN about

00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:20.954
whether he would be holding

00:00:20.954 --> 00:00:22.989
a press conference in Russia.

00:00:25.692 --> 00:00:27.594
We got booms, really.

00:00:27.594 --> 00:00:29.662
We are getting ready for a long,

00:00:29.662 --> 00:00:30.897
hard war.

00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:32.766
Really, the fireworks datacentre,

00:00:32.766 --> 00:00:33.266
they see him

00:00:33.266 --> 00:00:35.468
in the first message to CNN

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:37.837
is that you have to respect Russia.

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:40.573
Your visit with him right now.

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:41.574
Prigozhin went on to issue

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:42.709
a violent threat.

00:00:42.709 --> 00:00:44.210
Violent and graphic threat.

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:45.545
Certainly not the first time

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:46.913
that Prigozhin has lashed out,

00:00:46.913 --> 00:00:48.581
of course, under pressure.

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:50.483
The war he is fighting

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:52.218
has caused that pressure, right.

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:53.086
Making its way deeper

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:54.454
into Russian territory.

00:00:54.454 --> 00:00:55.755
Drone and artillery attacks

00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:57.657
inside the country are on the rise

00:00:57.657 --> 00:00:58.291
so much

00:00:58.291 --> 00:00:58.825
that Vladimir

00:00:58.825 --> 00:01:00.260
Putin's top propagandist

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:02.095
is now saying that nuclear weapons

00:01:02.095 --> 00:01:02.829
should be used

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:04.064
to destroy Elon Musk's

00:01:04.064 --> 00:01:05.231
StarLink satellites,

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:06.800
which is the crucial technology

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:07.634
that Ukraine

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:10.403
is believed to use

00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:13.006
to launch drone strikes

00:01:14.641 --> 00:01:15.708
There's two parter.

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:17.877
I think it's time to turn up the heat.

00:01:17.877 --> 00:01:19.879
We understand that all drones

00:01:19.879 --> 00:01:21.548
and everything else works

00:01:21.548 --> 00:01:24.117
for Americans only while StarLink exists.

00:01:24.384 --> 00:01:26.286
So if we carefully launch

00:01:26.286 --> 00:01:27.987
our nukes into space,

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:31.458
then there will be no StarLink left.

00:01:31.825 --> 00:01:34.694
Sam Kiley is OUTFRONT

00:01:35.995 --> 00:01:37.130
Ukraine's not claiming

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:38.865
responsibility for these attacks

00:01:38.865 --> 00:01:40.366
inside Russia.

00:01:40.366 --> 00:01:42.268
But if Kiev gets blamed,

00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:43.837
that's just fine.

00:01:43.837 --> 00:01:45.105
There's more to come.

00:01:45.105 --> 00:01:46.873
Ivan, you've said that it's a vulnerable

00:01:46.873 --> 00:01:48.508
to what one of say there.

00:01:48.508 --> 00:01:49.576
The number of incidents

00:01:49.576 --> 00:01:51.511
is constantly increasing,

00:01:51.511 --> 00:01:53.012
not only in the border areas,

00:01:53.012 --> 00:01:55.215
but also in the depths of Russia.

00:01:55.215 --> 00:01:57.117
It's already happening.

00:01:57.117 --> 00:01:59.752
The scale will be exponential here.

00:01:59.752 --> 00:02:00.086
An oil

00:02:00.086 --> 00:02:01.421
refinery in Russia's far

00:02:01.421 --> 00:02:03.256
south is set aflame

00:02:03.256 --> 00:02:04.357
while along Ukraine's

00:02:04.357 --> 00:02:06.392
northern border with its invader,

00:02:06.392 --> 00:02:08.761
civilian areas are hit by shelling

00:02:09.295 --> 00:02:10.463
apartments riddled

00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:13.066
with shrapnel commonplace in Ukraine.

00:02:13.399 --> 00:02:16.035
A new experience for Russians.

00:02:16.035 --> 00:02:18.404
Ukraine's new strategy is taking shape

00:02:18.738 --> 00:02:20.640
inside Russia.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:22.108
Drone and artillery attacks

00:02:22.108 --> 00:02:23.343
have hit Russian targets

00:02:23.343 --> 00:02:24.644
in an arc along

00:02:24.644 --> 00:02:26.646
its Ukrainian border provinces

00:02:26.646 --> 00:02:27.347
of Bryants,

00:02:27.347 --> 00:02:30.950
Kursk, Belgorod, Verona and Krasnodar.

00:02:31.551 --> 00:02:33.553
And Moscow's not been spared either

00:02:34.287 --> 00:02:36.523
on the deck of a Royal Navy warship.

00:02:36.523 --> 00:02:37.757
Key Ukrainian ally,

00:02:37.757 --> 00:02:39.125
the United Kingdom,

00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:41.494
gave Kiev a green light to attack Russia.

00:02:41.694 --> 00:02:42.795
Legitimate military

00:02:42.795 --> 00:02:43.963
targets beyond its own

00:02:43.963 --> 00:02:44.764
border

00:02:44.764 --> 00:02:48.067
are part of Ukraine's self-defense.

00:02:49.469 --> 00:02:51.471
And we should recognize eyes.

00:02:51.704 --> 00:02:52.906
We should recognize that.

00:02:52.906 --> 00:02:53.606
In response,

00:02:53.606 --> 00:02:54.240
former Russian

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:55.275
president and close

00:02:55.275 --> 00:02:57.610
Putin ally Dmitri Medvedev

00:02:57.911 --> 00:02:59.145
