00:03:03.516 --> 00:03:04.617
any British official

00:03:04.617 --> 00:03:06.152
could be considered

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:08.188
as a legitimate military target.

00:03:08.621 --> 00:03:10.623
Now, that would be an escalation

00:03:10.623 --> 00:03:13.193
even Vladimir Putin might resist

00:03:17.297 --> 00:03:18.064
Now, Erin,

00:03:18.064 --> 00:03:19.999
