00:03:21.901 --> 00:03:22.602
That would be,

00:03:22.602 --> 00:03:24.270
I think, technically impossible.

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:26.105
I have to say also locally,

00:03:26.105 --> 00:03:28.608
they're not used by drones,

00:03:28.608 --> 00:03:29.375
certainly not drones

00:03:29.375 --> 00:03:30.043
